# The map markers' frozen layout (map service story 4): /Game/Mods/<Core>/Map/BP_Marker_<Kind> and E_MarkerItem.
# build.ps1 (step blueprint) compares CoreGen's -Layout= output for the generated markers, and for the author template's
# committed copies, with these lines and fails on any difference. Cooked levels are unversioned and store a placed
# marker's values by their position in its class's property list (docs/custom-maps.md stage 2), so once released
# nothing here changes: new settings and new E_MarkerItem values are only ever appended. Lines: per marker its
# parent, its components in SCS order, its own properties in the class's order (type, instance-editable, transient),
# its own functions; then E_MarkerItem's entries (index, internal name, value, display name).

